1. LoginTest: This test will login to the application and verify that the login was successful. It will take a screenshot after successful login and save it in the screenshots folder. 
2. NavigationTest: This test will navigate through the different pages of the application and verify that all the links are working properly. It will take a screenshot after each navigation step and save it in the screenshots folder. 
3. SearchTest: This test will search for specific terms in the application and verify that the search results are correct. It will take a screenshot after each search and save it in the screenshots folder. 
4. LogoutTest: This test will logout from the application and verify that the logout was successful. It will take a screenshot after logout and save it in the screenshots folder. 
5. All these tests are wrapped inside a single test suite which can be executed by running the command "cypress run". 
